      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Results of peridural morphine analgesia in 122 patients after operation were analysed. The duration of analgesia was established to be longer in this case and to improve the course of the postoperative period. Side effects of morphine (nausea, vomiting, skin itch) were noted in 6% of the cases."},
